BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Market Day at Brookfield Old Town Hall
DTSTART:20261004T120000
DTEND:20261004T150000
DTSTAMP:20261004T155147Z
UID:d37efac495af6a24d262352ac6cfab@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Brookfield farmers\, artisans\, crafters\, cooks and bakers wi
 ll join together to present a unique day of shopping\, eating\, community 
 and fun at the Brookfield Old Town Hall\, 93 Stone Rd in Brookfield. Farm 
 items will include honey\, maple syrup\, cider\, seasonal vegetables\, egg
 s\, mushrooms\, fresh roasted coffee\, chicken\, beef and pork. Craft item
 s include organic dried flower arrangements\, sketches and photography\, h
 and knit accessories\, handcrafted functional and decorative pottery inclu
 ding bowls\, mugs\,vases etc. There will be fiction by a local author. The
 re will be handwoven items\, handmade arts\, crafts and curiosities\, and 
 herbal wellness and apothecary products. New this year are hand woven loca
 l willow baskets and decorative items. Lunch items courtesy of the Brookfi
 eld Old Town Hall committee will feature a variety of hearty soups and bre
 ad. The Hall is steps from the very picturesque Floating Bridge so make a 
 day of it! Thanks to our event sponsor Chimney Savers.\n\nSources: Vermont
  Public
LOCATION:Brookfield Old Town Hall\, 93 Stone Road
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/market-day
 -at-brookfield-old-town-hall-10-09-2026-13-53-51
END:VEVENT
